---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
---
<Base title="About SEOULIS — seoul.is" description="SEOULIS is a premier editorial platform covering K-pop, K-drama, Seoul travel, and Korean culture. Seoul Is Where You Belong.">
  <main style="max-width:860px;margin:0 auto;padding:60px 24px;color:var(--text);">

    <div style="margin-bottom:12px;">
      <span style="font-size:11px;font-weight:700;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:1.5px;color:#C9A84C;">Editorial Publication</span>
    </div>
    <h1 style="font-size:2.8rem;font-weight:900;margin-bottom:8px;line-height:1.15;">
      <span style="color:var(--primary)">SEOULIS</span> — Seoul Is Where You Belong
    </h1>
    <p style="color:var(--text-muted);margin-bottom:48px;font-size:1.1rem;line-height:1.7;">
      The go-to editorial destination for K-culture lovers, Seoul travelers, and anyone whose heart beats a little faster for Korea.
    </p>

    <h2 style="font-size:1.3rem;font-weight:700;margin-bottom:12px;">Our Mission</h2>
    <p style="line-height:1.85;color:var(--text-secondary);margin-bottom:24px;">
      SEOULIS (seoul.is) was founded with a single conviction: the world's appetite for Korean culture deserves a home that matches its energy. We are an independent editorial platform aggregating and curating the best of Korea — K-POP, K-DRAMA, Michelin-starred food, emerging neighborhoods, lifestyle trends, and insider travel intelligence — sourced daily from 50+ premium Korean and international outlets. Every story we publish is selected by our editorial team for its relevance, accuracy, and genuine value to our global community of Korea fans.
    </p>

    <h2 style="font-size:1.3rem;font-weight:700;margin-bottom:12px;">What We Cover</h2>
    <ul style="line-height:2.1;color:var(--text-secondary);margin-bottom:32px;padding-left:20px;">
      <li>🎵 <strong style="color:var(--text);">K-POP</strong> — Comebacks, chart analysis, artist updates, and fan culture</li>
      <li>📺 <strong style="color:var(--text);">K-DRAMA</strong> — New releases, streaming picks, cast interviews, and recaps</li>
      <li>🍜 <strong style="color:var(--text);">Food & Dining</strong> — Seoul restaurant picks, Michelin guides, trending menus, and food crawls</li>
      <li>📍 <strong style="color:var(--text);">Hottest Spots</strong> — Neighborhoods, pop-ups, concept stores, and hidden gems</li>
      <li>✈️ <strong style="color:var(--text);">Travel Seoul</strong> — Visa guides, itineraries, transport tips, and visitor essentials</li>
      <li>🏠 <strong style="color:var(--text);">Lifestyle & Culture</strong> — Fashion, beauty, wellness, and the everyday Seoul aesthetic</li>
    </ul>

    <h2 style="font-size:1.3rem;font-weight:700;margin-bottom:12px;">Our Editorial Standards</h2>
    <p style="line-height:1.85;color:var(--text-secondary);margin-bottom:24px;">
      We take accuracy seriously. Every article is reviewed before publication. Sponsored content and affiliate links are clearly disclosed in accordance with our <a href="/editorial" style="color:#C9A84C;text-decoration:underline;">Editorial Policy</a>. If you spot an error, we want to know — and we correct it publicly. Our readers trust us, and we earn that trust every day.
    </p>

    <h2 style="font-size:1.3rem;font-weight:700;margin-bottom:12px;">Our Sources</h2>
    <p style="line-height:1.85;color:var(--text-secondary);margin-bottom:32px;">
      We curate from 50+ premium sources including Naver, Dispatch, Koreaboo, Allkpop, The Korea Herald, Korea JoongAng Daily, Time Out Seoul, Michelin Korea, Lonely Planet Korea, and leading K-culture creators across YouTube and social media. Our curation is human-guided, not purely algorithmic — an editorial team reviews every feed daily.
    </p>

    <h2 style="font-size:1.3rem;font-weight:700;margin-bottom:12px;">The Team</h2>
    <p style="line-height:1.85;color:var(--text-secondary);margin-bottom:32px;">
      SEOULIS is built and operated by K-culture enthusiasts, journalists, and Seoul insiders who live and breathe the city. Our editorial team spans Seoul, Hong Kong, and global K-culture hubs. We are K-PROP Limited, incorporated in Hong Kong, committed to bringing the world closer to Korea through thoughtful, curated media.
    </p>

    <h2 style="font-size:1.3rem;font-weight:700;margin-bottom:12px;">Join the SEOULIS Community</h2>
    <p style="line-height:1.85;color:var(--text-secondary);margin-bottom:24px;">
      We're more than a media site. Through our <a href="/membership" style="color:#C9A84C;text-decoration:underline;">Seoul Prime Club</a> membership and the <a href="/spot" style="color:#C9A84C;text-decoration:underline;">SEOULIS SPOT</a> café partnership network, we're building a real-world community for Korea lovers everywhere.
    </p>

    <h2 style="font-size:1.3rem;font-weight:700;margin-bottom:12px;">Contact Us</h2>
    <p style="line-height:1.85;color:var(--text-secondary);margin-bottom:8px;">For advertising, partnerships, sponsorships, or general inquiries:</p>
    <p style="margin-bottom:8px;"><a href="mailto:hello@seoul.is" style="color:#C9A84C;font-weight:700;">hello@seoul.is</a></p>
    <p style="line-height:1.85;color:var(--text-secondary);margin-bottom:8px;">For editorial corrections or content concerns:</p>
    <p style="margin-bottom:32px;"><a href="mailto:editorial@seoul.is" style="color:#C9A84C;font-weight:700;">editorial@seoul.is</a></p>

    <div style="margin-top:40px;padding:24px;background:rgba(201,168,76,0.06);border-radius:12px;border:1px solid rgba(201,168,76,0.2);">
      <p style="color:var(--text-muted);font-size:13px;margin:0;">
        <strong style="color:var(--text);">SEOULIS / seoul.is</strong> is operated by K-PROP Limited, Hong Kong. All editorial content is subject to our <a href="/editorial" style="color:#C9A84C;">Editorial Policy</a> and <a href="/privacy" style="color:#C9A84C;">Privacy Policy</a>.
      </p>
    </div>
  </main>
</Base>
